RCP 1
M title One-pan tomato pasta
M serves 2
M time 20
I 200|g|spaghetti
I 250|g|cherry tomatoes, halved
I 1||onion, thinly sliced
I 3|clove|garlic, sliced
I 2|tbsp|olive oil
I 1||/2 tsp chilli flakes
I 700|ml|water
I ||salt, to taste
I ||basil, to garnish
I 30|g|parmesan, grated
S 0
T Lay everything except the basil and
T parmesan in a wide pan; season well.
S 540
T Bring to a boil and cook, turning the
T pasta with tongs as the water reduces.
S 180
T Keep tossing until the liquid becomes a
T glossy sauce that coats the strands.
S 0
T Serve with basil and parmesan.
